## Testing Protocol

For each feature group:
1. Extract specific files from stash: `git checkout stash@{0} -- <path>`
2. Review changes: `git diff HEAD -- <path>`
3. Test functionality (where applicable)
4. Commit if passing: `git add <path> && git commit -m "restore: <description>"`
5. Mark line as complete in this file

## Stash Commands Reference

```bash
-- View stash contents
git stash show -p stash@{0}

-- Extract single file from stash
git checkout stash@{0} -- path/to/file

-- Extract untracked file from stash
git show stash@{0}^3:path/to/file > path/to/file

-- View specific file in stash
git show stash@{0}:path/to/file

-- Drop stash when done (preserves in reflog for 30 days)
git stash drop stash@{0}
```

